		<unit label="article" identifier="5" level="5">Mine Rescue Teams</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>45.2-547</section_number>
	<catch_line> Duty to train teams</catch_line>
	<text>
		It is the duty and responsibility of the Department to see that every team is properly trained by a qualified instructor of the Department or other person who has a certificate of training from the Department or MSHA.
	</text>
	<history>1975, c. 432, § 45.1-33.2; 1984, c. 590; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.69; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
